H-003 | Layered boundaries (qml/controllers/models/services/workers/persistence/playback) | §15.1 | P02, P13, P28, P46 | drift audits CP-A..K | tree | checkpoint audit | PLANNED |\\n24|| ARCH-004 | Qt Quick forced to OpenGL before first window | §15.1, §19.3 | P02, P47 | startup + render | `main.cpp`, `app.cpp` | manual/render | VERIFIED |\\n25|| ARCH-005 | Target-based CMake + Ninja | §15.5, §16.1 | P01 | configure/build | `CMakeLists.txt`, `cmake/Dependencies.cmake`, `CMakePresets.json` | build + ctest | VERIFIED |\\n26|| ARCH-006 | Two bounded worker pools + TaskToken | §15.3, §22.2 | P04 | cancellation/concurrency tests | `src/workers/*` | unit | VERIFIED |\\n27|| ARCH-007 | Typed domain errors + cooperative cancellation | §15.4 | P05, P04 | error/cancel tests | `core/errors.hpp` | unit | PLANNED |\\n28|| ARCH-008 | Project file tree by responsibility | §16 | P01 | layout inspection | tree | review | PARTIAL |\\n29|| ARCH-009 | QML module registration (`qt_add_qml_module`) | §15.5 | P03 | QML load | `qml/CMakeLists.txt`, `qml/QG/qmldir` (generated) | QML test | VERIFIED |\\n30|\\n31|## Filesystem & Navigation\\n32|\\n33|| ID | Requirement | Design Source | Planned Prompt(s) | Planned Test/Validation | Implementation | Tests | Status |\\n34||---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n35|| FS-001 | Each directory lists every child directory + supported video, nothing else | §5.1, §17.2, §25.1 | P07, P09 | temp-dir enum tests | `filesystem/enumerator` | integration | PLANNED |\\n36|| FS-002 | Child directories always shown, even empty | §1.1, §5.2, §25.1 | P09, P19 | folder-only dir test | enumerator/model | integration | PLANNED |\\n37|| FS-003 | Unsupported regular files filtered at enumeration | §5.1, §17.3 | P07, P09 | filter test | `media/formats.hpp` | unit | PLANNED |\\n38|| FS-004 | Incremental batches (~200) for first-screen responsiveness | §17.2, §22.4 | P09 | batch-signal test | enumerator | integration | PLANNED |\\n39|| FS-005 | Per-entry errors do not abort 