{"type": "tool_use", "name": "write_file", "input": {"path": "/home/treshen/Projects/QG/GUIDE_STATE.md", "content": "# QG Development Guide State\n\nAuthoritative execution ledger for `dev-guide.md`. Update after each prompt/checkpoint.\nStatuses: `PENDING`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `COMPLETE`, `BLOCKED`.\n\n## Pipeline\n\n- Bootstrap: **COMPLETE**\n- Pipeline Status: **READY**\n- Reconciliation: **DONE** (2026-10-08) — see \"Reconciliation Evidence\".\n- Last Item Completed: **P21**\n- Next dependency-ready item: **P22** (`StatusStrip`; CP-C branch)\n- Release Validation: **PENDING**\n\n## Development Prompts\n\n| Prompt | Task | Depends On | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| P01 | CMake/Ninja build foundation and dependency detection | None | COMPLETE |\n| P02 | Application bootstrap, OpenGL selection, XDG paths, logging | P01 | COMPLETE |\n| P03 | QML module, `Theme.qml`, `Main.qml` shell | P02 | COMPLETE |\n| P04 | Worker/task infrastructure (`TaskToken`, bounded pools) | P02 | COMPLETE |\n| P05 | Core domain types, errors, identity | P02 | COMPLETE |\n| P06 | SQLite persistence foundation, schema, migrations, repositories | P02 | COMPLETE |\n| P07 | Media format registry (`formats.hpp`) | P05 | COMPLETE |\n| P08 | Path/XDG helpers, filename validation | P02 | COMPLETE |\n| P09 | Filesystem enumerator with incremental batches | P04,P05,P07,P08 | COMPLETE |\n| P10 | Canonical `FolderModel` and card roles | P05,P09 | COMPLETE |\n| P11 | Mount discovery + `PlacesModel` | P03,P08 | COMPLETE |\n| P12 | Directory watcher + debounced refresh diff | P09,P10 | COMPLETE |\n| P13 | `BrowserController` navigation stack + model population | P09,P10,P12 | COMPLETE |\n| P14 | QML `PathBar` | P03,P13 | COMPLETE |\n| P15 | QML `PlacesSidebar` | P03,P11 | COMPLETE |\n| P16 | Wiring: nav region → BrowserController → FolderModel → ContentView | P13,P14,P15 | COMPLETE |\n| P17 | `ContentView` grid host, focus cursor, type-to-select plumbing | P10,P16 | COMPLETE |\n| P18 | `VideoCard` delegate with full state matrix | P17,P10 | COMPLETE |\n| P19 | `FolderCard` delegate (mosaic, count chip) | P17,P10 | COMPLETE |\n| P20 | Density modes + `CompactRow` delegate | P17,P18,P19 | COMPLETE |\n| P21 | `ContextStrip` | P13,P20 | COMPLETE |\n| P22 | `StatusStrip` | P13 | PENDING |\n| P23 | Thumbnail cache + freedesktop cache reader | P06,P10 | PENDING |\n| P24 | FFmpeg in-process frame extraction/scaling | P04,P23 | PENDING |\n| P25 | Visible-first priority scheduler + decoded-image LRU | P17,P24 | PENDING |\n| P26 | Failure markers, retry/backoff, source invalidation | P23,P24 | PENDING |\n| P27 | Wiring thumbnail results → `FolderModel` roles | P10,P25,P26 | PENDING |\n| P28 | `MediaProbeService` (FFmpeg in-process probing) | P04,P06,P09 | PENDING |\n| P29 | Identity↔path mapping repository + reconciliation | P05,P06 | PENDING |\n| P30 | `StateController`: favorite/watched/progress persistence | P06,P10,P29 | PENDING |\n| P31 | Per-folder sort persistence (settings repository) | P06,P13 | PENDING |\n| P32 | Wiring probe results → model roles + unknown handling | P10,P28 | PENDING |\n| P33 | `SortService` + `SortSpec` deterministic total order | P05,P10 | PENDING |\n| P34 | Order menu + sort wiring | P14,P31,P33 | PENDING |\n| P35 | `SelectionState`: identities, focus index, range anchor | P10,P17 | PENDING |\n| P36 | Keyboard shortcut framework + focus movement | P17,P35 | PENDING |\n| P37 | Type-to-select buffer | P17,P35,P36 | PENDING |\n| P38 | Accessibility: roles, screen reader, high-contrast, reduced motion | P03,P17,P36 | PENDING |\n| P39 | `SearchService`: substring/rank matching, match ranges | P05,P10 | PENDING |\n| P40 | `SearchProxy` (`QSortFilterProxyModel`) | P10,P39 | PENDING |\n| P41 | `SearchController`: debounce, scope, summary | P39,P40 | PENDING |\n| P42 | PathBar search-field morph | P14,P41 | PENDING |\n| P43 | Manifest `ListView` + `ManifestRow` + sortable header | P17,P40,P41 | PENDING |\n| P44 | No-results state + scroll/selection restoration | P42,P43 | PENDING |\n| P45 | Wiring search → ContentView presentation swap | P41,P43,P44 | PENDING |\n| P46 | `mpv_backend.cpp`: single handle + render context | P02,P05 | PENDING |\n| P47 | `VideoSurfaceItem`: `QQuickItem` + scene-graph render node | P02,P46 | PENDING |\n| P48 | `PlaybackManager` + `PlaybackSession` (one-player policy) | P46,P47,P29 | PENDING |\n| P49 | `PlaybackContext`: ordered list, index, step(±1) | P10,P33 | PENDING |\n| P50 | `Stage.qml` container + geometry | P17,P47,P48 | PENDING |\n| P51 | `TransportBar.qml` + control wiring | P48,P50 | PENDING |\n| P52 | Wiring playback: activation → controller → Stage surface | P48,P49,P50,P51 | PENDING |\n| P53 | Card→Stage bloom animation + grid reflow | P50,P52 | PENDING |\n| P54 | Cinema state (in-window fullscreen, chrome/cursor hide) | P50,P52 | PENDING |\n| P55 | `ReelModel` + `ReelPanel.qml` | P17,P48,P49 | PENDING |\n| P56 | Previous/Next wiring + end-of-folder behavior | P49,P55 | PENDING |\n| P57 | Position persistence, resume policy | P06,P30,P48 | PENDING |\n| P58 | Wiring Stage↔Cinema continuity + Reel highlight sync | P53,P54,P55,P56,P57 | PENDING |\n| P59 | `FileOperationsService` (rename/move/copy/reveal/open-with/properties) | P08,P09,P29 | PENDING |\n| P60 | `TrashService` (gio + freedesktop + undo) | P08,P09 | PENDING |\n| P61 | `ActionsController` + context menu | P59,P60 | PENDING |\n| P62 | Inline rename editor on card | P18,P59,P61 | PENDING |\n| P63 | Cut/Copy/Paste + drag & drop | P59,P61 | PENDING |\n| P64 | `ToastHost` + undo orchestration | P03,P60,P61 | PENDING |\n| P65 | Dialogs (Properties/Open With/Confirm Delete/Rename Conflict) + D-Bus reveal | P59,P61 | PENDING |\n| P66 | Wiring actions → minimal model row diffs + state consistency | P10,P29,P61,P62 | PENDING |\n| P67 | `StateOverlay` (empty/loading/error) + skeleton grid | P17,P45 | PENDING |\n| P68 | Drive disconnect / error handling | P11,P48,P67 | PENDING |\n| P69 | Large-directory performance tuning + benchmarks | P09,P25,P28,P40 | PENDING |\n| P70 | High-DPI/fractional scale + reduced-motion/high-contrast hardening | P38,P67 | PENDING |\n| P71 | Leak/resource profiling + ASan/UBSan test builds | P01,P25,P46,P59 | PENDING |\n| P72 | Desktop entry + AppStream metadata + icons | P03 | PENDING |\n| P73 | Native `.deb` packaging + install rules | P72 | PENDING |\n| P74 | Optional AppImage portable recipe | P73 | PENDING |\n\n## Checkpoints\n\n| Checkpoint | Name | Depends On | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| CP-A | Foundation Checkpoint | P01–P06 | COMPLETE |\n| CP-B | Filesystem Browser Checkpoint | P07–P16 | COMPLETE |\n| CP-C | Visual Browser Checkpoint | P17–P22 | PENDING (blocked only by P22) |\n| CP-D | Thumbnail Pipeline Checkpoint | P23–P27 | PENDING |\n| CP-E | Metadata & Persistence Checkpoint | P28–P32 | PENDING |\n| CP-F | Sorting, Keyboard & Accessibility Checkpoint | P33–P38 | PENDING |\n| CP-G | Search Checkpoint | P39–P45 | PENDING |\n| CP-H | Playback Foundation Checkpoint | P46–P52 | PENDING |\n| CP-I | Playback Experience Checkpoint | P53–P58 | PENDING |\n| CP-J | File Operations Checkpoint | P59–P66 | PENDING |\n| CP-K | Release Readiness Checkpoint | P67–P74 | PENDING |\n\n## Final Integration\n\nStatus: PENDING (precedes RV-01; awaits CP-K)\n\n## Release Validation\n\nStatus: PENDING\n\n## Reconciliation Evidence (2026-10-08)\n\nReconcile pass re-derived status from source + executed validation (not from prior ledger text).\n\n- Source tree matches P01–P21 exactly: `src/` (config/logging/core/workers/persistence/filesystem/models/controllers), `qml/QG` (Main, Theme, Format, PathBar, PlacesSidebar, ContentView, delegates/VideoCard+FolderCard+CompactRow, strips/ContextStrip), `tests/` (14 CTest targets + `tests/qml/*`).\n- **No artifacts of P22+ exist**: no `StatusStrip.qml`, no `media/thumbnails|probe`, no `playback/`, no `search/`, no `sorting/`, no `filesystem/operations|trash`, no `packaging/`. Recorded \"P22 next\" is accurate; the ledger was **not** behind the implementation.\n- Configure: `cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja` → OK (only pre-existing non-fatal warnings: `qg_qml` OUTPUT_DIRECTORY vs target-path; deferred `qt6_finalize_target`).\n- Build: `cmake --build build` → clean (no work to do on re-run).\n- `ctest --test-dir build` **with `TMPDIR=/tmp`** → **14/14 PASS** (qg_smoke, qg_xdg_paths, qg_qml, qg_workers, qg_core, qg_persistence, qg_formats, qg_paths, qg_enumerator, qg_folder_model, qg_mounts, qg_places_model, qg_watcher, qg_browser_controller).\n- `qg_qml_test` → **50/50 subtests PASS** (P03, P14–P21 QML/component/wiring tests).\n- Recovered statuses: P01–P21 COMPLETE; P22–P74 PENDING; CP-A, CP-B COMPLETE; CP-C–CP-K, FI-01, RV-01 PENDING.\n- No implementation beyond P21 was found; nothing was regressed by manual edits.\n\n## Known Issues / Environment Fragility\n\n- **`qg_watcher` test is temp-filesystem-dependent.** `tst modelDiffPreservesUnaffectedRows` (P12) removes `gone.mp4` then creates `added.mp4`; on a filesystem that **reuses the just-freed inode** (observed on ext4 — e.g. the Hermes agent scratch `TMPDIR` under `/home`), the two files collide on inode identity, so `computeFolderDiff` classifies the change as `dataChanged` instead of remove+add and `removed.count()` is 0. On `/tmp` (tmpfs, no immediate inode reuse) the test passes. This is test-fixture fragility, **not** a product regression: identity-keyed diffing is per DESIGN §17.5/§17.8, and the recorded P12 PASS is valid under the standard environment.\n  - **Recommendation for the runner:** run CTest with a tmpfs temp, e.g. `TMPDIR=/tmp ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure`. Hardening the fixture (or making the diff collision-aware) is a legitimate follow-up but is out of scope for this state-repair pass.\n- `qmllint` emits a non-fatal \"Failed to import qg\" self-import warning (known `QT_RESOURCE_ALIAS` layout limitation; runtime resolution verified).\n- Anomaly from 2026-10-07 (an unidentified writer briefly modified P03 QML files) is **RESOLVED**; tree quiescent and current build/tests green.\n\n## Blockers\n\nNone. Autonomous execution can resume at **P22**.\n\n## Notes\n\n- P01–P21: foundation, core domain, persistence, enumerator/model/watcher, mounts/Places, BrowserController, and the full Browse visual stack (PathBar, PlacesSidebar, ContentView, VideoCard, FolderCard, CompactRow/densities, ContextStrip) are implemented and validated.\n- Architecture in place: `main.cpp` forces OpenGL before the first window and holds no business logic; `qg_core` is the single static non-UI library; `FolderModel` is the single canonical ordered row model; workers are bounded pools with `TaskToken`; persistence is SQLite WAL with the generated single-source schema.\n- CP-C will additionally check: a synthetic large model does not create one QML object per row; focus ≠ selection; responsive columns 700–1920px, cards ≤320px; and the \"no raw hex outside `Theme.qml`\" drift audit — these are not yet exercised (they are CP-C work, after P22)."}, "timestamp": 1791452423901}
